 just had to give the Microsoft support a ring and they solved my issue easily after entering my error code. Could've been a mistake but something to keep in mind.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1601856000}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Computer Software Type\",\"value\":\"Operating Systems Software\"},{\"name\":\"Operating System\",\"value\":\"Windows 10\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Windows\"},{\"name\":\"Number of Users\",\"value\":\"1\"},{\"name\":\"Physical Media Format\",\"value\":\"USB Stick\"},{\"name\":\"Version\",\"value\":\"10\"},{\"name\":\"Product Line\",\"value\":\"Windows\"},{\"name\":\"Model\",\"value\":\"111027\"},{\"name\":\"Languages Supported\",\"value\":\"English\"},{\"name\":\"Manufacturer\",\"value\":\"Microsoft\"},{\"name\":\"Has Written Warranty\",\"value\":\"No\"}],\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\nWindows 10 Home USB with expanded Start menu and familiar pinned apps\\nFast startup and resume with built-in security features\\nIncludes MS Edge browser and Cortana for web and task management\\nSupports virtual desktops and up to four snapped apps in one view\\nAccess the new Windows Store for a unified shopping experience\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nWindows 10 is designed to work with software and hardware you already have. The Windows Insider Program allows fans to see the operating system in its earliest stages and provide feedback that has contributed to the best Windows ever.\\nFunction \\u0026 Performance\\nThe Start menu is back in an expanded form, bringing over your pinned apps and favorites. You can easily snap up to four apps in place and see all open tasks in a single view. You can even create virtual desktops when you need more space or want to group things by project.\\nUsage/Scenarios\\nMS Edge is an all-new browser built to give you a better web experience. You can write or type notes directly on web pages and share them with others, read online articles free of distraction, and save your favourite reads for later access. With Cortana enabled, you get instant access to key actions like making reservations or reading reviews without leaving the page.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"walmart-566322691\",\"product_id\":120000131765642,\"cspu_id\":\"100000018988146\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Windows-10-Home-USB-New-Original-Box-Win10-Home/566322691\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":6494000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Sensible Fox\",\"supplier_rating\":4.125,\"website\":\"walmart\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-824ij-mput674daadqbc\",\"review_data\":{\"featured_reviews\":[{\"user_name\":\"Samantha\",\"rating\":1,\"content\":\"Scam seller. Item was not in box as expected. Received a FedEx envelope with a USB and bootleg instructions.\"},{\"user_name\":\"S\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"wanted an old version windows 10 before the support stop on this version. Found one here at a good price , installed easy whit no problems.\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"user_name\":\"Grizzthor\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"very easy to install\",\"sort_order\":2}]}},\"rcmd_reason_tag\":[\"Easy to Use\",\"Safer\",\"Faster\"],\"rcmd_reason\":[\"Easier Use: expanded Start menu and familiar favorites make Windows 10 easy.\",\"Safer Computing: more built-in security helps keep users safe.\",\"Faster Workflow: fast startup and resume help reduce waiting.\"],\"rcmd_reason_markdown\":\"- **Easier Use:** expanded Start menu and familiar favorites make Windows 10 easy.\\n- **Safer Computing:** more built-in security helps keep users safe.\\n- **Faster Workflow:** fast startup and resume help reduce waiting.\",\"product_tags\":[{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Easy to Use\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Safer\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Faster\"}],\"like_info\":{\"state\":1,\"item_id\":null,\"cspu_id\":null,\"country\":\"US\",\"state_v