mbine ingredients without spilling out of the pan. I came across Made In, and the Stainless Clad Saucier. It was about the same size as my sauce pan, but with the higher sides. I read reviews on it and liked what I saw. I ordered it and have just started using it. I am impressed with the quality of the pan. It is very easy to handle, and clean-up has been easy. It has worked very well for a couple of pasta dishes I've made since receiving it. I would highly recommend this pan.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1790371338},{\"comment_id\":324503411,\"user_name\":\"Anthony\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Since I received my saucier, I have cooked a variety of different dishes. It really exceeded my expectations. I am finding that it is the perfect size for so many things especially pasta dishes. I am pleasantly surprised that for once a product lives up the to hype!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1790360339}]},\"item_details\":{\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\nMade in Italy, five-ply stainless steel construction\\nTriple aluminum core for optimal heat conduction\\nNon-reactive, induction-compatible cooking surface\\nCornerless design for thorough whisking and emulsification\\nStay-cool handles and rolled rim for easy pouring\\nOven-safe to 800°F; dishwasher-safe, hand washing recommended\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nThis 3-quart saucier features a magnetic stainless steel exterior and a tight-fitting lid to lock in steam. The layered structure eliminates hot spots to prevent stuck-on food and simplify cleanup. It pairs with other Made In cookware for a timeless, traditional kitchen look.\\nMaterials \\u0026 Craftsmanship\\nThe cookware includes a stainless steel lid and hollow stainless steel stay-cool handles. The cooking surface is non-reactive and corrosion-resistant, while the magnetic exterior ensures compatibility with all stovetops, including induction.\\nCare Instructions\\nThe pan is metal utensil-safe. While dishwasher-safe, hand washing is recommended to maintain quality.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"Made In Cookware-509269082142-39604606730319\",\"product_id\":120000565544644,\"cspu_id\":\"100000016569496\",\"url\":\"https://checkout.madeincookware.com/products/saucier?variant=39604606730319\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":17499000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Made In Cookware\",\"supplier_rating\":4.9118,\"website\":\"Made In Cookware\",\"review_data\":{\"featured_reviews\":[{\"user_name\":\"Reasedaddy\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Made-In cookware is everything it is it is advertised to be. The 3 qt Saucier pan is a pleasure to cook with. Everything seems to come out perfect. I like the way it retains just the right amount of heat. Nice size and weight for a meal for two to four people. And it is sturdy. Very well made as you would expect.\"},{\"user_name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"The Made In saucier is unbelievably responsive, heating evenly without a single hot spot while the curved walls make whisking sauces completely effortless. It has easily become my most reached-for pan for everything from delicate reductions to silky custards.\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"user_name\":\"Dubble J\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I have not had a chance to cook with these yet but I absolutely love the way they look and feel. They are of high quality and seem to be very well designed, nothing fancy, simply well done.\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"user_name\":\"Dave\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I was using a sauté pan for a variety of pasta dishes, but the lower sides of the pan made it more work to stir and combine ingredients without spilling out of the pan. I came across Made In, and the Stainless Clad Saucier. It was about the same size as my sauce pan, but with the higher sides. I read reviews on it and liked what I saw. I ordered it and have just started using it. I am impres