0,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"usd\"}},\"variation_infos\":{\"tier_variations\":[{\"name\":\"Size\",\"options\":[\"4.0 lbs\"],\"display_indicators\":[0]},{\"name\":\"Multipack Quantity\",\"options\":[\"4\"],\"display_indicators\":[0]}]},\"model_infos\":{\"models\":[{\"offer_id\":\"walmart-6VJXKC8WHSWX\",\"extinfo\":{\"tier_index\":[0,0]}}],\"cur_model_idx\":0},\"review_data\":{\"summary\":{\"total_count\":36682,\"summary_text\":\"Most customers left positive feedback, praising the good value and highly palatable formula that dogs eagerly eat, though some noted they would need to pick out small bits. Conversely, a few buyers reported infestations with worms in three out of four bags purchased and questioned the justification for spending extra money compared to cheaper alternatives.\",\"rating_max\":4.7},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":313549964,\"user_name\":\"LuLu\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"We have 3 large pups and they seem to enjoy this dog food better than most dry kibble. We add a little fresh chicken to top it off most days but even when we don't, the dogs don't complain too much. We like the protein content and it is an economical choice.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"create_time\":1784332800},{\"comment_id\":313549961,\"user_name\":\"Kristen\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"We were feeding our 4 dogs Purina Pro Plan Sport for about 4-5 years, but I noticed my dogs gaining weight with it. So we switched to this one, less protein and fat as they are getting older and not “go go go” puppies anymore. Also a cheaper alternative as the cost of literally everything has increased!! They have stayed a healthy weight since! Their coat is still shiny like from pro plan, no artificial colors or dyes. Gentle on my dogs stomachs. Haven't noticed any issues and we have been using it for a few months now. I have a Great Dane, two dachshunds, and a golden doodle. I follow portion sizes and they seem to have adjusted well to it. Can't complain!\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1783382400},{\"comment_id\":313549967,\"user_name\":\"Rachel\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This has been a great dog food for my adult dog. I appreciate that real chicken is the first ingredient and that it's a high-protein formula. My dog eagerly eats every meal, has great energy, and seems to be doing really well on it. The 8 lb bag is a convenient size and offers great quality for the price.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1782691200},{\"comment_id\":313549974,\"user_name\":\"anonymous\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"We tried another brand that was recommended and my boy Seven dropped weight because he could only be coaxed to eat it once a day even with toppers and not always the whole bowl. He's already a leaner breed so I was worried. We switched to Purina One (he loves chicken %26 rice) and he went crazy for it. He loves it and it'll help him regain his bulk since we'll be hiking more this Summer ❤️\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1782172800},{\"comment_id\":195295255,\"user_name\":\"Celia\",\"rating\":1,\"content\":\"My dog has resisted eating this food. When he got hungary enough and ate it, he puked it up. I think there is a problem with the food I purchased and am throwing it out. I will order new food soon. Please check this out.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1778025600}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Brand Name\",\"value\":\"Purina ONE\"},{\"name\":\"Flavor\",\"value\":\"Chicken \\u0026 Rice\"},{\"name\":\"Age Range Description\",\"value\":\"Adult\"},{\"name\":\"Item Form\",\"value\":\"Pellet\"},{\"name\":\"Specific Uses For Product\",\"value\":\"Breath Care, Dental Care, Digestive Health, Eye Care, Heart Care, Hip and Joint Support, Immune Support, Sensitive Skin, Sensitive Stomach, Skin and Coat Health\"},{\"name\":\"Special Ingredients\",\"value\":\"protein-rich\"},{\"name\":\"Container Type\",\"va