ighlights\\nWeekly spray cleaner eliminates soap scum and grime without scrubbing\\nBleach-free formula safe for most bathroom surfaces except natural marble\\nLight vanilla scent with no harsh fumes\\nCleans glass, tile, chrome, stone, vinyl, and fabric shower curtains\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nWet \\u0026 Forget Shower Cleaner is designed for weekly application to prevent the buildup of soap scum, everyday shower grime, and heavy calcium deposits. One weekly spray cleans and maintains a sparkling shower, tub, and glass shower doors. Heavy calcium deposits may require a pre-cleaning step before use.\\nMaterials \\u0026 Craftsmanship\\nThe formula is bleach-free and safe for use on fiberglass, granite, porcelain, stone, vinyl, and chrome. It is not safe for use on natural marble. The product features a light vanilla scent and contains no harsh fumes.\\nUsage/Scenarios\\nSuitable for showers, tubs, shower basins, tile, and fabric shower curtains. It cleans stubborn surface stains but does not remove stains permanently sealed in silicone or grout.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"amazon-B0CYSH2WX1-B01ENDOJ0G\",\"product_id\":120000568815383,\"cspu_id\":\"100000002012490\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/Wet-Forget-Application-Scrubbing-Bleach-Free/dp/B01ENDOJ0G?th=1\\u0026psc=1\\u0026language=en_US\\u0026currency=USD\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":1999000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Amazon.com\",\"supplier_rating\":4.2,\"website\":\"amazon\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-825a2-mqmt8xcg7abw3c\",\"video_urls\":[\"https://www.amazon.com/vdp/d2442790a25d48ffb69330c9634ba89a\"]},\"rcmd_reason_tag\":[\"No-Scrub\",\"Build-Up Blocking\",\"Surface Safe\"],\"rcmd_reason\":[\"Easier Cleaning: weekly spray cleans and rinses away soap scum and grime.\",\"Build-Up Defense: weekly use helps prevent soap scum and calcium deposits.\",\"Safe: formula works