s product for its excellent value, especially at a price of $1500 or lower, citing the Ryzen AI 7 processor, 32GB of RAM, and RTX 5070 as the drivers for outstanding performance. However, a smaller number of users note that the fan noise becomes noticeably loud under heavy load, with some describing the sound as extremely loud.\",\"rating_max\":4.5677},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":336088536,\"user_name\":\"EDUARDOD\",\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"Overall good for the price, battery is definitely a sore spot though.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"create_time\":1792647518},{\"comment_id\":336088538,\"user_name\":\"RChiu\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This is an incredible thin and light gaming laptop. It was very well priced when discounted and has incredible specs. The CPU is a little underpowered, but the upgradable 32GB of DDR5 RAM (2x 16GB) and 1TB SSD (1 of 2 slots filled) makes it a solid future proofed laptop. The laptop 5070 is also very underpowered compared to the desktop version, but its acceptable.\\n\\nThe build quality is pretty nice, the frame is lightweight and rigid. The abundance of ports makes it very nice to use, although the power plug situation is not great. It takes in a barrel adapter and also USB-C PD, but its on the left side of the laptop and near the middle, making it cumbersome.\\n\\nThe laptop did not come with too much bloatware, just the GiMate software that is supposed to make your settings smarter. It can do fancy things like turning off your screen when you leave, rather than just detect for input inactivity.\\n\\nOne thing that may trip up users is that the AI power settings turns off the dedicated 5070 GPU if the laptop is on battery. It disappears from the system entirely when turned off so it might cause confusion. Plug your laptop in before jumping to conclusions.\\n\\nI personally use this laptop for travel, to do light gaming and overall web browsing. This laptop is perfect for that.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1792514034},{\"comment_id\":336088535,\"user_name\":\"ABDULK\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I bought laptop from Best Buy which is working amazing\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1792470744},{\"comment_id\":336088539,\"user_name\":\"customer12345\",\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"Honestly I saw pretty modest reviews before purchasing this item. But I'm glad to say that I've been pleasently surprised. This laptop has some good battery life especially considering the components it has. The performance is also as expected which is good.\\nA couple things that weren't great though. Although it's pretty thin and light, the build quality isn't great with some flex in the bottom of the laptop due to it's vents and in the middle of the keyboard deck. This laptop also only features one usb C port and one usb A 2.0 port which is kind of insane at this day and age.\\nAll in all it's been good to me both while at work and while doing some gaming on the side.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1792456995},{\"comment_id\":336088537,\"user_name\":\"Luke\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I picked up this laptop for both college and some portable gaming, it has been handling everything great for the casual gamer. Great for running Davinici resolve for my light video editing as well. Best part is the fact that it weighs just around 4lbs, great for leaving in my backpack for both work and travel.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1792436110}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Screen Type\",\"value\":\"IPS\"},{\"name\":\"Screen Size\",\"value\":\"16 inches\"},{\"name\":\"Screen Resolution\",\"value\":\"2560 x 1600\"},{\"name\":\"Touch Screen\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"Refresh Rate\",\"value\":\"165Hz\"},{\"name\":\"Brightness\",\"value\":\"400 nits\"},{\"name\":\"Processor Model\",\"value\":\"AMD Ryzen AI 300 Series\"},{\"name\":\"CPU Base Clock Frequency\",\"value\":\"2 gigahertz\"},{\"n