dern travelers.\\nUsage/Scenarios\\nAdditional features include a luggage pass-through sleeve that slides over wheeled luggage handles, two expandable stretch water bottle pockets for hydration, and adjustable backpack straps with a sternum strap for added carrying support.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"amazon-B0FMFQZY5X-B0CN1H9GL5\",\"product_id\":120000604265407,\"cspu_id\":\"100000012720079\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/Osprey-Daylite-Expandable-Travel-Pack/dp/B0CN1H9GL5?th=1\\u0026psc=1\\u0026language=en_US\\u0026currency=USD\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":10487000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"ILS Retail Group\",\"supplier_rating\":4.7,\"website\":\"amazon\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-825a2-mqmt8xcg7abw3c\",\"video_urls\":[\"https://www.amazon.com/vdp/040cad8dacff49759fbc1a7dd03bc59c\"]},\"rcmd_reason_tag\":[\"Flexible\",\"Comfortable\",\"Protective\"],\"rcmd_reason\":[\"Flexible Packing: 26+6L expandable design adapts from personal item to carry-on.\",\"Cool Support: AirScape mesh foam padding keeps the back cool and supported.\",\"Tech Protection: a dedicated sleeve safeguards laptops or tablets.\"],\"rcmd_reason_markdown\":\"- **Flexible Packing:** 26+6L expandable design adapts from personal item to carry-on.\\n- **Cool Support:** AirScape mesh foam padding keeps the back cool and supported.\\n- **Tech Protection:** a dedicated sleeve safeguards laptops or tablets.\",\"product_tags\":[{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Flexible\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Comfortable\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Protective\"}],\"like_info\":{\"state\":1,\"item_id\":null,\"cspu_id\":null,\"country\":\"US\",\"state_version\":\"0\"}}}","at":1792812312198,"synthetic":1},{"k":"fetch","m":"POST","u":"https://sg.migoo.test.shopee.io/beeai/api/v1/pdp/info","b":"{\"region\":\"US\",\"cspu_id\":\"100000021417597\",\"offer_id\":\"walmart-16504472\"}","s":2